### 用户登录获取 Token
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user6",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    // 根据当前后端响应的 {"token": "..."} 结构自动提取并缓存
    client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token);
%}